a) Local Group Policy

Configured on one Windows computer.

PC001
  ↓
Local Policy

It mainly affects that individual machine.

b) Domain GPO

Managed centrally through Active Directory.

Domain Controller
       ↓
      GPO
       ↓
PC001
PC002
PC003
...

Therefore:

Local policy = individual computer

Domain GPO = centrally managed policy for domain users/computers
